{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19623","headline":"石佛谷 · 皇甫湜","name":"石佛谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[澶漫]太行北，千里一块石。\n平腹有壑谷，深广数百尺。\n土僧何爲者，老草毛发白。\n寝处容身龛，足膝隐成迹。\n金僊琢灵象，相好倚北壁。\n花座五云扶，玉豪六虚射。\n文人留纪述，时事可辨析。\n鸟迹巧均分，龙骸极癯瘠。\n枯松间槎枿，猛兽恣腾掷。\n蛣𧎜虫食纵，悬垂露凝滴\n精艺贯古今，穷岩谁爱惜。\n托师禅诵余，勿使尘埃积。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}